# Privacy Policy for Light the Lamp: Puzzle Game

**Last Updated:** July 14, 2026

Welcome to **Light the Lamp: Puzzle Game**, developed by OcenSoft ("we", "our", or "us").

Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains what information may be collected when you use the app and how that information is handled.

By downloading or using the app, you agree to this Privacy Policy.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

Light the Lamp does not require an account, registration, or login.

We do not directly collect personally identifiable information such as:

- Name
- Email address
- Phone number
- Home address

Game progress, settings, stars, streaks, unlocked levels, and preferences are stored locally on your device.

---

## 2. Third-Party Services

To support the game through advertising, we use third-party services.

### Google AdMob

The app displays banner, interstitial, and rewarded advertisements using Google AdMob.

AdMob may automatically collect information such as:

- Advertising ID
- Device information
- Approximate location
- IP address
- App interaction information
- Diagnostic information

This information is collected directly by Google and is governed by Google's Privacy Policy.

- [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)
- [How Google uses information from sites or apps](https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites)

---

## 3. Local Storage

The game stores gameplay information locally on your device using secure local storage.

This may include:

- Completed levels
- Stars earned
- Daily streak
- Game settings
- Audio preferences
- Haptic settings
- Notification preference

This information never leaves your device and is not transmitted to our servers.

---

## 4. Notifications

If you choose to enable Daily Reminder notifications, the app schedules local notifications on your device.

These reminders are generated entirely on your device. No personal information is sent to any notification server.

You may disable notifications at any time from the in-game Settings screen or your device settings.

---

## 5. Internet Connection

Most gameplay is available offline.

An internet connection is only required for certain features such as viewing rewarded advertisements provided by Google AdMob.

---

## 6. Children's Privacy

The app is not directed toward children under the age of 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

If you believe that a child has provided personal information through a third-party service, please contact us and we will investigate the matter.

---

## 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.

When changes are made, the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page will be updated.

